WEBVTT

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.864
he was the chairman
of the House of Representatives,

00:05:31.888 --> 00:05:33.196
and he resigned in disgrace

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.148
when this young Republican named
Newt Gingrich found out about

00:05:36.172 --> 00:05:37.840
a shady book deal that he had done.

00:05:37.864 --> 00:05:39.023
He lost everything.

00:05:39.047 --> 00:05:41.784
The most powerful Democrat
in the country lost everything:

00:05:41.808 --> 00:05:43.580
he lost his money, he lost his power.

00:05:43.604 --> 00:05:46.252
What does he have to say
all these years later about it?

00:05:46.276 --> 00:05:49.016
"I am so much better off physically,
financially, mentally

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:50.523
and in almost every other way."

00:05:50.547 --> 00:05:52.753
What other way would there be
to be better off?

00:05:52.777 --> 00:05:55.138
Vegetably? Minerally? Animally?

00:05:55.162 --> 00:05:56.997
He's pretty much covered them there.

00:05:57.021 --> 00:05:59.437
Moreese Bickham is somebody
you've never heard of.

00:05:59.461 --> 00:06:02.512
Moreese Bickham uttered
these words upon being released.